# DERIVED from spike/out/imap.trace. The finding F14 recorded, as a transcript: the same
# server answers CAPABILITY differently before and after authentication. A client that reads
# once, before LOGIN, concludes there is no CONDSTORE — and then sees HIGHESTMODSEQ in the
# very next SELECT, which only a CONDSTORE server sends.
